{"id":8879779381447,"title":"Pamnest Twin Halloween Comforter Set with Sheets, 5 Pieces - Design 06","handle":"pamnest-twin-halloween-comforter-set-with-sheets-5-pieces-design-06","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience ultimate comfort and spooky style with the Jeminise Comforter Set. This 5-piece bedding set, featuring a captivating Halloween theme, is designed to provide exceptional softness and breathability for a peaceful night's sleep. Perfect for adding a festive and cozy touch to your bedroom, it's an ideal choice for all seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Material:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted with finely brushed microfibers for exceptional softness, lightness, and breathability, ensuring maximum comfort.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eContent Included:\u003c\/strong\u003e Comes with a comforter (68\" x 90\"), flat sheet (66\" x 92\"), fitted sheet (39\" x 80\" x 14\"), one pillowcase (20\" x 30\"), and one pillow sham (20\" x 30\"). Pillow inserts are not included.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExquisite Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features stylish and exquisite patterns with a Halloween theme, adding a touch of fashion and coziness to your sleeping space.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurable Stitching:\u003c\/strong\u003e Comforter includes exquisite stitching that enhances durability and prevents filling from shifting or clumping.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Fit:\u003c\/strong\u003e The deep-pocket fitted sheet is designed with an elastic band on all four sides to accommodate mattresses up to 14 inches thick, ensuring a secure fit.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Simply machine wash in cold water and tumble dry on low; designed to withstand years of use without weakening or tearing.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Suitable for all seasons, offering comfort whether it's fall, summer, winter, or any time of year.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJeminise\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eProduct Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eComforter Set\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eMaterial\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePolyester\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFabric Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBrushed Microfiber and Polyester Filling.\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSelected Design\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eGhost 1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eTheme\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHorror Cartoon\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003ePattern\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePumpkin,Ghost,Bats\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eIncluded Components\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1 x Comforter \u0026amp; 1 x Pillowcase \u0026amp; 1 x Pillow Sham \u0026amp; 1 x Fitted Sheet \u0026amp; 1 x Flat Sheet\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eAvailable Sizes\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTwin\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eDimensions\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e90 x 68 x 1 inches\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecial Feature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eElastic Band, Deep Pocket\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSeasons\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAll, Fall, Summer, Winter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eCare Instructions\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eMachine Wash\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\